  "name": "mistral.rs",
  "description": "A high-performance multimodal inference engine written in Rust, optimized for low-latency execution of Large Language Models across diverse hardware backends. It incorporates advanced memory management through PagedAttention and continuous batching, alongside comprehensive support for adapter techniques such as LoRA, X-LoRA, and AnyMoE. The system provides integrated agentic capabilities, including native tool calling and web search, accessible via unified Rust and Python SDKs or an OpenAI-compatible server.",
